tches\n- material application (models look/presentation)\n- more cad and mesh file formats support (currently only OBJ meshes can be exported)\n- more mesh operations\n- ability to define procedures as node groups to be reused across graphs", "short_description": "Procedural node based CAD solution for precision design in Mixed Reality"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cadnodes.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rafa\u0142 Ostrowski", "support_website_url": "https://cadnodes.com/contact", "website_url": "https://cadnodes.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8128855623796866"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974468_941888870679036_4731364262526301159_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YA1ovj-0H_EQ7kNvwGGPMzK&_nc_oc=AdoPMD3YxryOaia74bx-oxt2-YSdzHtlTSxEybuTOH03ypj_6B7Xubi-WaJ2vuMpAfA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3typWsFYz5QJRiukpueVWm3LMdKKlI9zaJdjNAkT356Q&oe=69EB71C6"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "CAD Nodes", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Creativ